msgid ""
"The KMS reported this version of the key encryption key when it encrypted "
"the data encryption key. Some providers need it to decrypt, and the rest "
"keep it for reference. It is empty where the provider reports no version."
msgstr ""

#: .\models.py:185
msgid ""
"This crypto backend, such as 'tink' or 'cryptography', generated the data "
"encryption key. The application checks it when it loads the key, so a "
"different backend never loads it. It is empty for a blind index key."
msgstr ""

